      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should this be done only on userdebug ? I\u0027m wondering if it could affect production CTS, considering that this is using FIREWALL_CHAIN_OEM_DENY_3 which may be used by some OEMs for something else",
      "revId": "d47491f7165dfb66add8b0d79f4e024e220d2cdb",
