      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-19T14:05:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think so. The reason this code is taking care to restore the status afterwards is to avoid interfering with OEM code using this ; I think it\u0027s better to root out the flakes on OEM devices trying to clear CTS. It\u0027s true that if the OEM device is trying to change that setting DURING the CTS, then it\u0027ll have a bad surprise afterwards, but it\u0027s extremely unlikely and I think it beats hands down subjecting them to inscrutable flakes.",
      "parentUuid": "8427be87_5096d209",
      "revId": "d47491f7165dfb66add8b0d79f4e024e220d2cdb",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
